 },
 "instructions": "## AIN-UI\n\n- Lay out with Column, Row and Grid; group with Card. Short text is Text, Title or Caption; prose is Markdown.\n- Files: a Grid of Tile for a folder, FileView for one file, Breadcrumbs for the path, FileUpload to add one. A private file is an asset reference in the data model ({\"$asset\": {...}}), never a URL you invent.\n- A payment is X402Payment with the exact terms you were given. Rendering it moves no money; the user clicks.\n- Pick a file with FilePicker and an agent with AgentPicker.\n- Give every Button an event name the agent will recognise, and put what it needs in the event context.\n- End a surface with FollowUp when there are obvious next questions."
}